0 185 L148.82990189069514 51.19034780080244 A140 140 0 0 1 156.57847828036918 49.04779558262305 Z" fill="#628bba" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"></path><rect x="370" y="244" width="13" height="13" fill="#628bba"></rect><text x="393" y="256" fill="#173f59" font-size="13" font-family="Arial">Thổ Nhĩ Kỳ: 0.91%</text><path d="M190 185 L156.57847828036918 49.04779558262305 A140 140 0 0 1 163.82628229763927 47.46841634869054 Z" fill="#a7ad57" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"></path><rect x="370" y="276" width="13" height="13" fill="#a7ad57"></rect><text x="393" y="288" fill="#173f59" font-size="13" font-family="Arial">Nhật Bản: 0.84%</text><path d="M190 185 L163.82628229763927 47.46841634869054 A140 140 0 0 1 170.97439568121925 46.298787387041244 Z" fill="#787878" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"></path><rect x="370" y="308" width="13" height="13" fill="#787878"></rect><text x="393" y="320" fill="#173f59" font-size="13" font-family="Arial">Đức: 0.82%</text><path d="M190 185 L170.97439568121925 46.298787387041244 A140 140 0 0 1 189.99999999999997 45.0 Z" fill="#bac6cf" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"></path><rect x="370" y="340" width="13" height="13" fill="#bac6cf"></rect><text x="393" y="352" fill="#173f59" font-size="13" font-family="Arial">Các nguồn cung ứng khác: 2.17%</text></svg><figcaption>Nguồn: S&amp;P Global (theo tài liệu Word)</figcaption><details class="data-detail"><summary>Xem dữ liệu gốc của biểu đồ</summary><table><thead><tr><th>Chỉ tiêu</th><th>Tỷ trọng (hệ số)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ma-lai-xi-a</td><td>0.30</td></tr><tr><td>Việt Nam</td><td>0.26</td></tr><tr><td>In-đô-nê-xi-a</td><td>0.16</td></tr><tr><td>Xinh-ga-po</td><td>0.12</td></tr><tr><td>Thái Lan</td><td>0.07</td></tr><tr><td>Trung Quốc</td><td>0.03</td></tr><tr><td>Băng-la-đét</td><td>0.01</td></tr><tr><td>Thổ Nhĩ Kỳ</td><td>0.01</td></tr><tr><td>Nhật Bản</td><td>0.01</td></tr><tr><td>Đức</td><td>0.01</td></tr><tr><td>Các nguồn cung ứng khác</td><td>0.02</td></tr></tbody></table></detai